		"description": {
			"value": "<p><em>Whether by birth, ritual, or accident, you are infused with powers from the &amp;reference[elemental] plane of earth. Magic comes to you easily, and you have greater control over elemental earth than any other.</em></p><table><caption><p>The Earth Savant</p></caption><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\"><p>Level</p></th><th scope=\"col\"><p>Features</p></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Empowered Cantrips: <em>@UUID[Compendium.elkan5e.elkan5e-spells.Item.e213NWDPfjE5FIex]{Resistance}</em>, <em>@UUID[Compendium.elkan5e.elkan5e-spells.Item.2XgqGwjzUtXriiiq]{Shout}</em></p></td></tr><tr><td><p>3</p></td><td><p>@UUID[Compendium.elkan5e.elkan5e-class-features.Item.jkkXNDCGAmUnPIE6]{Fault Line}</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>6</p></td><td><p>@UUID[Compendium.elkan5e.elkan5e-class-features.Item.YqBvmFXBHIqhnuCl]{&amp;reference[elemental] Infusion}</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>10</p></td><td><p>@UUID[Compendium.elkan5e.elkan5e-class-features.Item.DZgUdMs55EklCVcU]{Ascendant Earth}</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>14</p></td><td><p>@UUID[Compendium.elkan5e.elkan5e-class-features.Item.nwKGf0KGVZrOY2kr]{Earth &amp;reference[elemental] Form}</p></td></tr></tbody></table><table><caption><p>Expanded Spell List</p></caption><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\"><p>Sorcerer Level</p></th><th scope=\"col\"><p>Extra Spells</p></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p><em>@UUID[Compendium.elkan5e.elkan5e-spells.Item.NKvSCOg8Wivgexw6]{Thunderwave}</em></p></td></tr><tr><td><p>3</p></td><td><p><em>@UUID[Compendium.elkan5e.elkan5e-spells.Item.cUZFvfqNa3nidrFs]{Arms of Earth}</em></p></td></tr><tr><td><p>5</p></td><td><p><em>@UUID[Compendium.elkan5e.elkan5e-spells.Item.dHrZ4B6DGvwhsBDR]{Rock Blast}</em></p></td></tr><tr><td><p>7</p></td><td><p><em>@UUID[Compendium.elkan5e.elkan5e-spells.Item.8Yd24rEnI9QvQgMo]{Stoneskin}</em></p></td></tr><tr><td><p>9</p></td><td><p><em>@UUID[Compendium.elkan5e.elkan5e-spells.Item.ul7SUrTTH4pEsVid]{Wall of Stone}</em></p></td></tr></tbody></tabl