						"replacement": "",
						"key": "system.description.value",
						"type": "override",
						"value": "<p><em>You straighten your back, drawing in as deep a breath as you can, then lean forward as you shout, letting out a sound far far louder and more dangerous than normal.</em></p><p><strong>Constitution</strong> <strong>Save</strong></p><ul><li><p><strong>Failure:</strong> Target takes [[/damage 1d8 thunder]] damage.*</p></li><li><p><strong>Success:</strong> No damage.</p></li></ul><p><strong>*At Higher Levels:</strong> This spell's damage increases by 1d8 when you reach a total character or creature level of 5th level ([[/damage 2d8 thunder]]), 11th level ([[/damage 3d8 thunder]]), and 17th level ([[/damage 4d8 thunder]]).</p>"
					},
